    ingredients: ["200 g parboiled (idli) rice","50 g raw rice","100 g whole urad dal","½ tsp fenugreek seeds","3 tbsp sour curd","3 tbsp ghee","1 tbsp gingelly (sesame) oil","1.5 tsp black peppercorns, coarsely crushed","1.5 tsp cumin seeds","½ tsp dry ginger powder (sukku)","1 inch ginger, finely chopped","12 cashew nuts, broken","2 sprig curry leaves, chopped","¼ tsp asafoetida","to taste salt"],
